     "subject": "Revised delivery dates and allocation - open Halden POs after your 22 September notice",
     "body": "Dear Li Wei,\n\nThank you for your notice of 22 September about the fire at Plant 2. You said you would send revised delivery dates by 10 October. We have not yet received them, so we are following up. Please send them as soon as you can.\n\nFor each line below, please give the revised promised date and the quantity you can ship on it:\n\nHPO-26-00450 line 10, HR-40110, 355 EA\nHPO-26-00450 line 20, HR-40120, 445 EA\nHPO-26-00532 line 10, HR-40130, 1,320 EA\nHPO-26-00532 line 20, HR-40210, 163 EA\nHPO-26-00532 line 30, HR-40210, 144 EA\nHPO-26-00614 line 10, HR-40110, 435 EA\nHPO-26-00614 line 20, HR-40110, 350 EA\nHPO-26-00614 line 30, HR-40230, 250 EA\nHPO-26-00670 line 10, HR-40120, 400 EA\nHPO-26-00670 line 20, HR-40130, 1,030 EA\n\nPlease also tell us what allocation you can commit to Halden from Plant 1 or elsewhere while Plant 2 is down, and the earliest date each part could ship.\n\nWe also have two older lines, PO-10711 line 1 and PO-10788 line 1. Please confirm whether they are still open on your side.\n\nThis request is for information only. It does not change any term of our Supply Agreement or waive any of Halden's rights under it, and it does not accept the notice or agree any revised terms.\n\nBest regards,\nDana Reyes\nHalden Robotics"
